{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen up, comrade! Tired of feeling like a terrible chess player? Ditch the flashy modern tools. My routine is simple: I teach you a sharp concept, you apply it in a\u00a0puzzle, then I unveil the secret twist. Survive my training, and even lazy humans\u00a0can become masters of Soviet caliber.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo contains a small section of the full game, which includes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 Chapters from the Tactics 1 Module</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pin - Easy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pin - Medium</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pin - Hard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skewer - Easy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skewer - Medium</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skewer - Hard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fork - Easy</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 Chapters from the Basics Mode</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bishop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Queen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >King</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Knight</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pawn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Checkmate</p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your glorious Soviet tutor has arrived!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957250/extras/f18940e610fae905be6245ae3d52fdd6.poster.avif?t=1755632726\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957250/extras/f18940e610fae905be6245ae3d52fdd6.webm?t=1755632726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957250/extras/f18940e610fae905be6245ae3d52fdd6.mp4?t=1755632726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957250/extras/a13918d01f4488aead1a40c573a779cc.poster.avif?t=1755632726\" width=540 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957250/extras/a13918d01f4488aead1a40c573a779cc.webm?t=1755632726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957250/extras/a13918d01f4488aead1a40c573a779cc.mp4?t=1755632726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet BOT.VINNIK \u2014 the grumpy chess coach you never had. A titanium-brained</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > relic from another era, he\u2019s armed with elite knowledge, dry sarcasm, and zero </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >patience. He\u2019ll mock your every mistake\u2026 and still make you a better player.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick Up New Chess Concepts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957250/extras/410354596e1eb7d5c7b4130e7a4101f1.poster.avif?t=1755632726\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957250/extras/410354596e1eb7d5c7b4130e7a4101f1.webm?t=1755632726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957250/extras/410354596e1eb7d5c7b4130e7a4101f1.mp4?t=1755632726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BOT.VINNIK introduces bite-sized chess lessons in a clear and engaging way, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >making it easy to understand essential concepts quickly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solidify Your Understanding Through Short Puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957250/extras/a130382b2940490f2d2c25b0b703b7a8.poster.avif?t=1755632726\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957250/extras/a130382b2940490f2d2c25b0b703b7a8.webm?t=1755632726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957250/extras/a130382b2940490f2d2c25b0b703b7a8.mp4?t=1755632726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apply your freshly learned chess knowledge in quick and focused puzzles </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >designed to reinforce your skills immediately.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unlock New Lessons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957250/extras/4c548bd48a272149a28db6c70bed2f5e.poster.avif?t=1755632726\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957250/extras/4c548bd48a272149a28db6c70bed2f5e.webm?t=1755632726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3957250/extras/4c548bd48a272149a28db6c70bed2f5e.mp4?t=1755632726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through the academy's comprehensive curriculum, unlocking new </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >modules, puzzles, and advanced lessons as you progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get Help from Laika</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cla